  m_text: "The gameplay is a simple 3 step process. \nCup. Espresso Machine. Dessert.\nor\nDessert.
    Cup. Espresso Machine.\n\n\nThe color of the cup represents the type of drink.\nClick
    on the \"Serve\" button on the bottom right corner to finish the order and the
    \"Trash\" button on the bottom left corner to restart the current order."
